# GNOME desktop — installed on top of the base (system/config/packages.list)
# by the builder's dnf (system stage 5), weak dependencies off. Comments and
# blank lines are ignored.

# ── GNOME (Wayland) ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
gnome-shell
gdm
gnome-session
gnome-settings-daemon
gnome-control-center
# No gnome-keyring: GNOME 51's secret service is oo7 (oo7-daemon, pulled in by
# gnome-shell; pam_oo7 unlocks it at login). gnome-keyring's PAM module only
# logged "gkr-pam: unable to locate daemon control file" at every login.
adwaita-icon-theme
adwaita-sans-fonts
adwaita-mono-fonts
nautilus
gnome-terminal
gvfs
gvfs-fuse
gvfs-smb
gvfs-mtp
gvfs-gphoto2
gvfs-afc
gvfs-nfs
# No image viewer / PDF viewer / text editor in the core image — the core
# desktop is Nautilus + GNOME Terminal only. Users get Loupe, Papers, Text
# Editor etc. from Flathub.

# ── Portal ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
xdg-desktop-portal-gnome
